# Git Sync

## Directives

- Treat uncommitted work as an abnormal handover condition. Ask the user whether
  to preserve it while switching, handle it as existing branch work, or stop.
- Otherwise, switch to the default branch, fetch remote updates, and
  fast-forward only.
- Do not delete branches.

